  title="Sattva, Rajas, Tamas: How the Three Gunas Shape Your Mind &amp; Life — Sankalp"
  description="Understand the three Gunas — Sattva, Rajas, and Tamas. Learn how they influence your thoughts, perception, personality, and health through the lens of Bhagavad Gita and modern psychology."
  path="/blog/three-gunas-sattva-rajas-tamas.html"
  headline="Sattva, Rajas, Tamas: How the Three Gunas Shape Your Mind & Life"
